--- A truncating insert into the same table starts the numbering over and overwrites the split objects
data.1.tsv	200	300	499
data.tsv	300	0	299
500	124750
--- A second insert continues after the taken keys with s3_create_new_file_on_insert
data.1.tsv	300
data.2.tsv	300
data.3.tsv	100
data.4.tsv	300
data.5.tsv	200
data.tsv	300
1500	624250
